OracleAdapter.setManualUpdateInterval
├── when called by the owner with a non-zero interval
│   ├── it should update the manualUpdateInterval storage value
│   └── it should emit ManualUpdateIntervalSet with correct parameters
├── when called by a non-owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount including the caller
└── when interval is zero
    └── it should revert with ZeroAmount error